            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic vapour inhaler (10) for a user to inhale vapour generated by heating a flavour release medium (40), said electronic vapour inhaler (10) comprising an elongated housing (12); a power source (22); a chamber (24) formed in said elongated housing (12) and in which a capsule (26) being filled with said flavour-release medium (40) can be removably inserted; a control arrangement (20); and an induction heating arrangement (50), the operation of which being controlled by said control arrangement (20) and that includes an induction coil (52) which can be energized by said power source (22) to heat said flavour-release medium (40), wherein said control arrangement (20) includes a temperature selector to allow a user to select a desired vapour inhalation temperature.</p>
            </abstract>
